059D22             0098*   ; Input A is an ordinal in the current complete disk.  Output is the shared
059D22             0099*   ; candidate request block.  Carry means the bounded regional corpus clips the
059D22             0100*   ; requested cell.  The ordering is centre first, then clockwise rings, each
059D22             0101*   ; beginning at the northwestern cell; it is byte-identical to disk_offsets().
