059DA1             0149*   
059DA1             0150*   ; A is a dense coarse ordinal in the current mutable plan.  Manager q/r retain
059DA1             0151*   ; anchor q/offset-row so identity comparisons and paths require no side table.
059DA1             0152*   regular_provider_coarse_desired_at:
